# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, Git stores whatever the checkout produced and Windows CRLF
# churn makes generated files (routeTree.gen.ts in particular) show as modified
# with an empty diff — which blocks branch switches and hides real changes in
# the noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

# Windows-only scripts are more predictable with CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
